// Headless-regression fixture (sappkeys #4): the QUIET reference library,
// deliberately ~20 dB below the salamander fixture and tuned an octave down,
// so "which library actually sounded?" is answerable from the audio alone.
// Resolves the hint { "fm-piano1", "FM-Piano1" } — programs 3 "EP Mark I",
// 4 "EP Dyno", 5 "EP Crunchy".
<region> sample=../piano-tone.wav lokey=21 hikey=108 pitch_keycenter=60
         transpose=-12 volume=-20
